one_star_reviews.text:
It must be the worst landlord in Gothenburg. They only care about their profit margin. Their apartment is so well maintained by the company. In case of problems like rats in the basement storage. So the property manager buys some traps himself. And a little note on the door. No name or contact person. An elevator that breaks down every week. Front door that doesn't close.
I recommend not moving into any of Ivar Kjellberg's apartments.
//Magnus Rosqvist
